{title: Mere Liye Tum Kaafi Ho}
{artist: Ayushman Khurana}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Teri meri aisi judd gyi kahani,        [G] Ke judd jaata jaise do nadiyo ka pani
[A] Mujhe aage tere [G] saath behna hai,        [D] Jaana tumhe to hai ye baat jaani
[G] Ke aye zindagi kaise banti suhani,        [A] Mujhe har pal tere [G] saath rehna hai
[D] Tum kuch adhoorey se,        [D] Hum bhi kuch aadhey
[G] Aadha-aadha hum jo dono milaade,        [A] To ban jayegi apni ik zindgani
[Bm] Ye duniya mile na [G] mile hum ko,        [Bm] Khushiya bhaga dengi [G] har gam ko
[A] Tum saath ho fir [G] kya baaki ho,        [A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D]
[A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D],        [A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D]
[D] Ek asmaan ke hai hum do sitaare,        [G] Ke takraatey hai tootey hai bechaare
[A] Mujhe tum se [G] par ye kehna hai,        [D] Chakke jo do saath chaltey hai thode to
[G] Ghisne ragadney me chiltey hai thode,        [A] Par yuhi to kat tey hai kachche kinare
[Bm] Ye dil jo dhala teri [G] aadat me,        [Bm] Shaamil kia hai [G] ibaadat me
[A] Thodi khuda se bhi [G] maafi ho,        [A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D]
[A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D],        [A] Mere liye [G] tum kaafi ho [D]
